  "advStateOff": "Off",
  "advIntro": "Everything here is off to begin with. Each switch adds one more part of the wallet, in the place it belongs.",
  "advShowsHeader": "Shows more",
  "advNetworkHeader": "Network",
  "advNetworkHint": "How the wallet reaches the network. Standard connects directly; Tor can be turned on in Privacy & network. Tor only never connects directly: without Tor the wallet stays offline and says so on Home. Offline uses no network at all: you see your balance and history as last seen, and sending and receiving wait until you switch back.",
  "advOutputs": "Outputs",
  "advOutputsHint": "Shows the Outputs page, under Wallet and on Home. It lists the coins the balance is made of, lets you split or consolidate them, and sets the defaults a send uses. A split or consolidation in progress keeps the page visible.",
