  "advTechnicalHint": "Shows the technical rows on a payment's details: kernel, slate ID, commitments and block height. In Invoices, shows the address rotation and the count of dropped messages.",
  "advSendOptions": "Send options",
  "advSendOptionsHint": "Shows Strategy for sends and Split change in Settings › Transactions: which outputs a send spends, and whether its change is split. Stays visible while either is not at its default.",
  "advDirect": "Direct receiving",
  "advDirectHint": "Gives this phone a second address, reached over Tor. Others can pay it directly, without Epicbox. Works only while the app is open. Adds the Direct method to Send and Receive, and its state to Privacy & network. Stays visible while it is on.",
  "advServerDetails": "Server details",
  "advServerDetailsHint": "Shows hosts, latency, version and block height in the server pickers and on the status card, the relay address under Receive, and the invoice address in full.",
  "advRecheckHeight": "Recheck from a height",
